msgid "Configuration Reference"
msgstr "配置参考"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:44
msgid "Model fields"
msgstr "模型字段"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:46
msgid ""
"Most fields can also be set on a route, where the route's value wins. "
"`id` and `name` are read only on the model."
msgstr "大多数字段也可以写在路由上，此时以路由上的值为准。`id` 和 `name` 只在模型上读取。"

