#: ../developer/adding-models.md:78
msgid ""
"A model also takes `route` (below), `router` and `router_params` (see "
"[Choosing a router per model](routing.md#choosing-a-router-per-model)), "
"and `required_role`, the lowest user role that can see and call the "
"model."
msgstr ""
"模型还可以设置 `route`（见下文）、`router` 和 `router_params`（见[为每个模型选择 "
"router](routing.md#choosing-a-router-per-model)），以及 "
"`required_role`，即能看到并调用该模型的最低用户角色。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:82
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Without `required_role`, a model defaults to `free` only if it has no "
"price and every route is a `sglang`, `vllm` or `ollama` engine on "
"`localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, `0.0.0.0` or `host.docker.internal`. Every "
"other model defaults to `pro`, because a zero price does not prove the "
"upstream is free: an `openai_compat` route on localhost can forward to a "
"paid API, and a `${VAR}` URL cannot be classified. Set `required_role` to"
" choose another tier. `admin_only: true` is an older way to write "
"`required_role: admin`; an explicit `required_role` replaces it, except "
"that `required_role: free` with `admin_only: true` stays admin-only."
msgstr ""
"没有设置 `required_role` 时，只有在模型没有定价、且每条路由都是位于 "
"`localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`0.0.0.0` 或 `host.docker.internal` 上的 "
"`sglang`、`vllm` 或 `ollama` 引擎时，才默认为 `free`。其他模型都默认为 "
"`pro`，因为价格为零并不能证明上游免费：localhost 上的 `openai_compat` 路由可能转发到付费 API，`${VAR}`"
" 形式的 URL 也无法判断。要使用其他等级，请设置 `required_role`。`admin_only: true` 是 "
"`required_role: admin` 的旧写法；显式的 `required_role` 会取代它，但 `required_role: "
"free` 与 `admin_only: true` 同时出现时仍然只对管理员开放。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:92
msgid "Reasoning effort in the model listings"
msgstr "模型列表中的推理强度"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:94
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`/v1/models` lists the `reasoning_effort` values each model accepts, so a"
" client can offer only those. The OpenAI shape carries `reasoning: "
"{\"supported_efforts\": [...]}`. The Anthropic shape (an `anthropic-"
"version` header, or `/anthropic/v1/models`) carries "
"`capabilities.effort`: `supported`, plus one `{\"supported\": "
"true|false}` for each of `low`, `medium`, `high`, `xhigh` and `max`."
msgstr ""
"`/v1/models` 列出每个模型接受的 `reasoning_effort` 取值，客户端可以只提供这些选项。OpenAI 格式带有 "
"`reasoning: {\"supported_efforts\": [...]}`。Anthropic 格式（带 `anthropic-"
"version` 请求头，或请求 `/anthropic/v1/models`）带有 `capabilities.effort`：一个 "
"`supported`，以及 `low`、`medium`、`high`、`xhigh` 和 `max` 各一个 `{\"supported\":"
" true|false}`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:101
msgid ""
"A value is listed only when every route of the model delivers it. A route"
" delivers:"
msgstr "只有模型的每条路由都能传递某个取值时，才会列出它。一条路由传递的取值是："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:104
msgid "the keys of its `reasoning_effort_map`;"
msgstr "它的 `reasoning_effort_map` 的键；"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:105
msgid ""
"otherwise, on the OpenAI-compatible adapter (OpenRouter included) with "
"`reasoning_effort` in `supported_params`, its `reasoning_efforts`;"
msgstr ""
"否则，如果使用兼容 OpenAI 的 adapter（包括 OpenRouter）且 `supported_params` 中有 "
"`reasoning_effort`，取它的 `reasoning_efforts`；"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:107
msgid ""
"otherwise the levels of a matching [deployment preset](#deployment-"
"presets);"
msgstr "否则取匹配的[部署预设](#deployment-presets)中的级别；"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:108
msgid ""
"otherwise nothing, if `supported_params` leaves `reasoning_effort` out; "
"the model is then listed with no values (`supported: false`)."
msgstr ""
"否则，如果 `supported_params` 中没有 "
"`reasoning_effort`，则不传递任何取值，模型会以空列表列出（`supported: false`）。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:111
msgid ""
"No effort information is listed (`reasoning: null`) when a route's "
"adapter does not forward the parameter (`anthropic`, `claude`, `gemini`) "
"or names `reasoning_effort` without a valid `reasoning_efforts` list. "
"Auto models list none."
msgstr ""
"如果某条路由的 adapter 不转发该参数（`anthropic`、`claude`、`gemini`），或者声明了 "
"`reasoning_effort` 却没有有效的 `reasoning_efforts` 列表，就不列出任何推理强度信息（`reasoning:"
" null`）。自动模型也不列出。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:116
msgid "Mapping reasoning-effort levels on a route"
msgstr "在路由上映射推理强度档位"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:118
msgid ""
"When the level clients send differs from the value a server takes, "
"declare the translation with `reasoning_effort_map` on the route. Each "
"key is a public level (what clients send as `reasoning_effort`, "
"`reasoning.effort` on Responses or `output_config.effort` on Messages, "
"and what `/v1/models` lists). Each value is what this server receives as "
"`reasoning_effort`."
msgstr ""
"如果客户端发送的级别与服务器接受的取值不同，就在路由上用 `reasoning_effort_map` "
"声明转换关系。每个键是一个公开级别（客户端以 `reasoning_effort`、Responses 中的 `reasoning.effort`"
" 或 Messages 中的 `output_config.effort` 发送的值，也是 `/v1/models` "
"列出的值）。每个值是这台服务器收到的 `reasoning_effort`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:139
msgid "On that route:"
msgstr "在这条路由上："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:141
msgid ""
"Only the keys are accepted, in their order (`low`, `high`, `max` above). "
"Any other level, including a switch such as `none`, is refused with `400`"
" before anything is sent."
msgstr ""
"只接受这些键，并按它们的顺序列出（上例中为 `low`、`high`、`max`）。其他任何级别，包括 `none` "
"这类开关，都会在发送任何内容之前以 `400` 拒绝。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:144
msgid ""
"The level is translated once, by the route that serves the request. A "
"retry or fallback starts again from the client's level."
msgstr "级别只由实际处理请求的路由转换一次。重试或回退会重新从客户端发送的级别开始。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:146
msgid ""
"The route forwards `reasoning_effort` whatever `supported_params` says, "
"and ignores `reasoning_efforts`."
msgstr ""
"无论 `supported_params` 如何设置，该路由都会转发 `reasoning_effort`，并忽略 "
"`reasoning_efforts`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:148
msgid ""
"A request without a level sends none, and the gateway adds no default. "
"Claude Code, for one, sends `output_config.effort: high` when its user "
"chose nothing."
msgstr ""
"没有指定级别的请求不会发送级别，网关也不添加默认值。例如，用户什么都没选时，Claude Code 会发送 "
"`output_config.effort: high`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:151
msgid ""
"The map is allowed only on a route, and only on an OpenAI-compatible "
"kind; on `anthropic`, `claude` or `gemini` it is a configuration error. "
"Keys and values are up to 32 letters, digits, `_`, `.` or `-`. Admins can"
" set a route's map in the console; see [Routing tab](configuration.md"
"#routing-tab)."
msgstr ""
"这个映射只能写在路由上，且只能用于兼容 OpenAI 的 kind；在 `anthropic`、`claude` 或 `gemini` "
"上属于配置错误。键和值最多 32 个字符，由字母、数字、`_`、`.` 或 `-` 组成。管理员可以在控制台中设置路由的映射；见 [Routing"
" 标签页](configuration.md#routing-tab)。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:156
msgid "Deployment presets"
msgstr "部署预设"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:158
msgid ""
"A trusted backend extension can register a verified mapping with "
"`register_reasoning_effort_preset` (from "
"`serving.config.reasoning_effort_presets`) in its `register()` hook. A "
"preset names the upstream provider, adapter kind, exact upstream model ID"
" and base URL it was tested against, plus a display label and an "
"`effort_map`. It applies only to that exact target. The provider is the "
"route's real upstream, not its dashboard label; for an OpenRouter pin, "
"use provider `openrouter` and kind `openrouter[<pin>]`. Admin overrides, "
"route maps and a route's own effort declarations take precedence over a "
"preset."
msgstr ""
"受信任的后端扩展可以在它的 `register()` 钩子中用 `register_reasoning_effort_preset`（来自 "
"`serving.config.reasoning_effort_presets`）注册经过验证的映射。预设写明测试时使用的上游 "
"provider、adapter kind、准确的上游模型 ID 和 base URL，以及显示标签和 "
"`effort_map`。它只适用于这个确切的目标。这里的 provider 是路由真正的上游，而不是它的仪表盘标签；对固定的 "
"OpenRouter 上游，使用 provider `openrouter` 和 kind "
"`openrouter[<pin>]`。管理员覆盖、路由映射以及路由自己的推理强度声明都优先于预设。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:168
msgid "Automatic DeepSeek prices"
msgstr "自动同步 DeepSeek 价格"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:170
msgid ""
"To follow DeepSeek's published prices, set the official model as the "
"pricing source. It works for any route, self-hosted ones included. It "
"needs PostgreSQL, cannot be combined with `pricing_schedule`, and "
"supports `deepseek-flash` and `deepseek-v4-pro`."
msgstr ""
"要跟随 DeepSeek 公布的价格，把官方模型设为价格来源。它适用于任何路由，包括自托管的路由。它需要 PostgreSQL，不能与 "
"`pricing_schedule` 同时使用，支持 `deepseek-flash` 和 `deepseek-v4-pro`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:184
msgid ""
"Every five minutes the gateway reads DeepSeek's [English price "
"page](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/) (USD "
"accounting) or [Chinese price page](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-"
"cn/quick_start/pricing/) (CNY accounting), and Chinese public holidays "
"for this year and next from [holiday-cn](https://github.com/NateScarlet"
"/holiday-cn), a third-party dataset. No API key is sent to either. Peak "
"windows are resolved in UTC and switch locally at their boundaries. "
"Workers reload the stored prices every ten seconds, and each request "
"keeps the prices it started with."
msgstr ""
"网关每五分钟读取一次 DeepSeek 的[英文价格页](https://api-"
"docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/)（按 USD 记账）或[中文价格页](https://api-"
"docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing/)（按 CNY 记账），并从第三方数据集 "
"[holiday-cn](https://github.com/NateScarlet/holiday-cn) "
"读取今明两年的中国法定节假日。两者都不会收到任何 API key。高峰时段按 UTC 计算，并在边界时刻于本地切换。worker "
"每十秒重新加载一次已存储的价格，每个请求都沿用开始时的价格。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:193
msgid ""
"A failed fetch or parse keeps the last validated prices and is logged. A "
"first start needs stored prices or a successful fetch. An unrecognized "
"page or calendar never turns into zero prices or an empty holiday list. "
"The parser accepts DeepSeek's weekday schedule only while its UTC peak "
"windows stay within one Chinese calendar day."
msgstr ""
"获取或解析失败时，保留上一次验证过的价格并记录日志。首次启动需要已存储的价格或一次成功的获取。无法识别的页面或日历绝不会变成零价格或空的节假日列表。只有当"
" UTC 高峰时段都落在同一个中国日历日内时，解析器才接受 DeepSeek 的工作日价格安排。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:199
msgid "Calendar-aware prices"
msgstr "按日历调整价格"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:201
msgid ""
"`pricing_schedule` sets prices by UTC time. Before `effective_at`, "
"`pricing` applies. After it, each window's `pricing` applies inside its "
"half-open `[start, end)` range and `default` applies outside. `weekdays` "
"(ISO numbers, 1 = Monday) and `excluded_dates` (`YYYY-MM-DD`) limit the "
"UTC dates that use windows; other dates use `default` all day, and an "
"overnight window checks the current UTC date. You maintain these holidays"
" and prices yourself. A request keeps the prices selected at its start, "
"even if its stream crosses a boundary."
msgstr ""
"`pricing_schedule` 按 UTC 时间设置价格。`effective_at` 之前使用 "
"`pricing`。之后，在各窗口左闭右开的 `[start, end)` 区间内使用窗口自己的 `pricing`，区间外使用 "
"`default`。`weekdays`（ISO 编号，1 表示周一）和 `excluded_dates`（`YYYY-MM-DD`）限定哪些 "
"UTC 日期使用窗口；其他日期全天使用 `default`，跨夜窗口按当前 UTC "
"日期判断。这些节假日和价格需要你自己维护。请求沿用开始时选定的价格，即使流式响应跨过了边界。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:209
msgid ""
"For example, higher prices on weekday mornings, except on a listed "
"holiday:"
msgstr "例如，工作日早间提高价格，但列出的节假日除外："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:260
msgid "Route configuration"
msgstr "路由配置"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:262
msgid "Routes give one model several endpoints and split its traffic by weight:"
msgstr "路由为一个模型提供多个端点，并按权重分配流量："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:283
msgid "A route takes the model fields above, plus:"
msgstr "路由可以使用上面的模型字段，此外还有："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`kind`"
msgstr "`kind`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Adapter kind ([below](#supported-adapter-kinds)); defaults to the model's"
" `provider`"
msgstr "adapter kind（[见下文](#supported-adapter-kinds)）；默认为模型的 `provider`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`weight`"
msgstr "`weight`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "float"
msgstr "float"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Share of traffic (default 1.0). `0` keeps the route configured but "
"unused, even as a fallback"
msgstr "流量份额（默认 1.0）。`0` 表示保留路由配置但不使用，回退时也不用"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`api_keys`"
msgstr "`api_keys`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"A key pool instead of `api_key` (not both). The pool counts as one "
"endpoint, so put separate resources on separate routes"
msgstr "代替 `api_key` 的 key 池（两者不能同时设置）。整个池算作一个端点，所以彼此独立的资源要放在不同的路由上"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`embeddings_path`"
msgstr "`embeddings_path`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Embeddings path under `base_url`; see [Custom embeddings paths](#custom-"
"embeddings-paths)"
msgstr "`base_url` 下的 embeddings 路径；见[自定义 embeddings 路径](#custom-embeddings-paths)"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`optional`"
msgstr "`optional`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Skip only this route, with a warning, when a `${VAR}` key, `base_url` or "
"`embeddings_path` is unset or blank"
msgstr "当 `${VAR}` 形式的 key、`base_url` 或 `embeddings_path` 未设置或为空时，只跳过这条路由并发出警告"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`provider`, `provider_display_name`"
msgstr "`provider`, `provider_display_name`"

