"Dashboard label and display name; they do not select an adapter. See "
"[Naming a route in the dashboard](add-local-model.md#naming-a-route-in-"
"the-dashboard)"
msgstr ""
"仪表盘标签和显示名称；它们不决定 adapter。见[在仪表盘中命名路由](add-local-model.md#naming-a-route-"
"in-the-dashboard)"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`provider_type`"
msgstr "`provider_type`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "RouteWise cost category: `on_demand`, `quota` or `concurrency`"
msgstr "RouteWise 成本类别：`on_demand`、`quota` 或 `concurrency`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`deployment_type`"
msgstr "`deployment_type`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Admission class: `auto` (default; recognizes loopback and Docker-host "
"addresses), `self_hosted` (an engine you run, also on a LAN) or "
"`provider_api` (provider-key concurrency, even through a loopback proxy)."
" See [Outbound concurrency](routing.md#outbound-concurrency)"
msgstr ""
"准入类别：`auto`（默认；识别回环地址和 Docker 宿主机地址）、`self_hosted`（你自己运行的引擎，局域网上的也算）或 "
"`provider_api`（按 provider key 限制并发，即使经过回环代理）。见[出站并发](routing.md#outbound-"
"concurrency)"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`include_usage_in_stream`"
msgstr "`include_usage_in_stream`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Ask an OpenAI-compatible upstream for a final usage chunk, so cached and "
"tool-call tokens are measured, not estimated. On by default for "
"`deepseek`, `zai`, `kimi`, `minimax`, `vllm` and `sglang`. Set `false` "
"for an endpoint that rejects unknown fields. Route-only, and must be a "
"real boolean. OpenRouter always asks for usage"
msgstr ""
"要求兼容 OpenAI 的上游返回最后的用量块，这样缓存 token 和工具调用 token "
"是实测值而不是估算值。`deepseek`、`zai`、`kimi`、`minimax`、`vllm` 和 `sglang` "
"默认开启。对会拒绝未知字段的端点设为 `false`。只能写在路由上，且必须是真正的布尔值。OpenRouter 总会请求用量"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"`routewise_pool`, `quota_pool`, `concurrency_pool`, `quota_source`, "
"`quota`, `concurrency`"
msgstr ""
"`routewise_pool`, `quota_pool`, `concurrency_pool`, `quota_source`, "
"`quota`, `concurrency`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "RouteWise pool and budget metadata"
msgstr "RouteWise 的资源池与预算元数据"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`reasoning_effort_map`"
msgstr "`reasoning_effort_map`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Route-only; see [Mapping reasoning-effort levels on a route](#mapping-"
"reasoning-effort-levels-on-a-route)"
msgstr "只能写在路由上；见[在路由上映射推理强度级别](#mapping-reasoning-effort-levels-on-a-route)"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:299
msgid ""
"Without `provider:`, a route's dashboard label is its `kind`, so two "
"routes of the same kind share one row."
msgstr "没有 `provider:` 时，路由的仪表盘标签就是它的 `kind`，所以同一 kind 的两条路由会共用一行。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:302
msgid "Custom embeddings paths"
msgstr "自定义 embeddings 路径"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:304
msgid ""
"A base URL ending in `/v1` gets `/embeddings`, and any other base gets "
"`/v1/embeddings` (trailing slashes are removed first). For a gateway with"
" another prefix, set `embeddings_path` on the route:"
msgstr ""
"以 `/v1` 结尾的 base URL 会加上 `/embeddings`，其他 base URL 会加上 "
"`/v1/embeddings`（先去掉末尾的斜杠）。对于使用其他前缀的网关，在路由上设置 `embeddings_path`："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:329
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This route then calls `https://gateway.example/api/v2/embeddings`; its "
"fallbacks are unaffected. `null` or `\"\"` keeps the default. The field "
"is route-only, and Admin refuses a whitespace-only value, a non-string or"
" a `..` segment. A `${VAR}` value must resolve to a non-blank path: if it"
" does not, the catalog registers no models, unless the route is "
"`optional: true`, in which case only that route is skipped."
msgstr ""
"这条路由于是请求 `https://gateway.example/api/v2/embeddings`；它的回退路由不受影响。`null` 或 "
"`\"\"` 表示使用默认规则。该字段只能写在路由上，Admin 会拒绝只含空白的值、非字符串值或包含 `..` 的路径段。`${VAR}` "
"形式的值必须解析为非空路径：否则整个模型目录都不会注册任何模型；如果路由设置了 `optional: true`，则只跳过这条路由。"

