#: ../developer/adding-models.md:364
msgid "Weights across routes"
msgstr "路由之间的权重"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:366
msgid ""
"Traffic splits by the catalog weights, and Admin can override a weight "
"per endpoint without editing the catalog. On a gateway without a "
"database, the routing policy can also shift weights between local and "
"remote routes. See [Routing](routing.md)."
msgstr ""
"流量按模型目录中的权重分配，Admin "
"可以按端点覆盖权重，而无需编辑模型目录。在没有数据库的网关上，路由策略还可以在本地和远程路由之间调整权重。见[路由](routing.md)。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:371
msgid "OpenRouter routes"
msgstr "OpenRouter 路由"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:373
msgid ""
"Add the OpenRouter key in **Admin → Providers** (the keys are on its "
"overview page), then create the model and its OpenRouter route in **Admin"
" → Routing**. `config/examples/models.openrouter.json` is an example "
"catalog to import into `MODEL_CATALOG`, including a local model with an "
"OpenRouter fallback. Add the keys it references as secret settings first,"
" and check its model ids and prices for your account: the gateway bills "
"from catalog prices."
msgstr ""
"在 **Admin → Providers** 中添加 OpenRouter key（key 在它的概览页上），然后在 **Admin → "
"Routing** 中创建模型及其 OpenRouter 路由。`config/examples/models.openrouter.json` "
"是一份可以导入 `MODEL_CATALOG` 的示例模型目录，其中包括一个以 OpenRouter 作为回退的本地模型。导入前先把它引用的 "
"key 添加为秘密设置项，并按你的账户核对其中的模型 id 和价格：网关按模型目录中的价格计费。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:392
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`provider_model_id` is OpenRouter's name for the model, independent of "
"the `id` your clients use. With `kind: openrouter`, OpenRouter picks the "
"upstream provider. To pin one, use `kind: openrouter[<slug>]`, for "
"example `openrouter[deepinfra]`: requests then carry `provider: {order: "
"[<slug>], allow_fallbacks: false}`. A slug matches `[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+`, "
"optionally in `/`-separated segments (`deepinfra/turbo`); OpenRouter "
"lists them at <https://openrouter.ai/docs/features/provider-routing>. "
"Each pin gets its own `endpoint_id` and circuit breaker, while "
"`api_logs.provider` records `openrouter` for all of them."
msgstr ""
"`provider_model_id` 是 OpenRouter 对该模型的命名，与客户端使用的 `id` 无关。使用 `kind: "
"openrouter` 时，由 OpenRouter 选择上游 provider。要固定一个上游，使用 `kind: "
"openrouter[<slug>]`，例如 `openrouter[deepinfra]`：请求会带上 `provider: {order: "
"[<slug>], allow_fallbacks: false}`。slug 须匹配 `[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+`，可以有以 `/` "
"分隔的多段（`deepinfra/turbo`）；OpenRouter 在 "
"<https://openrouter.ai/docs/features/provider-routing> 列出了可用的 "
"slug。每个固定的上游都有自己的 `endpoint_id` 和熔断器，而 `api_logs.provider` 对它们都记为 "
"`openrouter`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:402
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An unpinned route created in Admin can set `openrouter_sort` to `price`, "
"`throughput` or `latency`, sent as `provider: {sort: <policy>}`. A pin "
"takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"在 Admin 中创建的未固定上游的路由可以把 `openrouter_sort` 设为 `price`、`throughput` 或 "
"`latency`，以 `provider: {sort: <policy>}` 发送。固定上游时以固定为准。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:406
msgid "`OpenRouterAdapter` also sends:"
msgstr "`OpenRouterAdapter` 还会发送："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:408
msgid ""
"`X-Title` and `HTTP-Referer`, from `SITE_NAME` and `SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`"
" (or `SITE_CONFIGURATION`). OpenRouter credits leaderboard placement and "
"free-tier limits to that site. Without a public address no `HTTP-Referer`"
" is sent, and without a name `X-Title` is `HybridInference`."
msgstr ""
"`X-Title` 和 `HTTP-Referer`，取自 `SITE_NAME` 和 `SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`（或 "
"`SITE_CONFIGURATION`）。OpenRouter 把排行榜排名和免费额度记在这个站点名下。没有公开地址时不发送 `HTTP-"
"Referer`，没有站点名称时 `X-Title` 为 `HybridInference`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:412
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`usage: {include: true}`, plus `stream_options: {include_usage: true}` "
"when streaming, so OpenRouter reports each request's cost. It is stored "
"as `upstream_cost_usd`, beside `cost_usd`, which is what the caller pays "
"at catalog prices."
msgstr ""
"`usage: {include: true}`，流式请求还会带上 `stream_options: {include_usage: "
"true}`，这样 OpenRouter 会报告每个请求的费用。该费用存为 `upstream_cost_usd`，与之并列的 "
"`cost_usd` 则是调用方按模型目录价格支付的金额。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:426
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:428
msgid "Model not appearing in `/v1/models`"
msgstr "模型没有出现在 `/v1/models` 里"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:430
msgid ""
"At startup the backend logs `Registered N routes from the database route "
"catalog`, or an error when the catalog is empty or was refused (`The "
"model catalog (MODEL_CATALOG in Admin > Providers > Models) was not "
"registered: …`)."
msgstr ""
"后端启动时会记录 `Registered N routes from the database route "
"catalog`；模型目录为空或被拒绝时则记录一条错误（`The model catalog (MODEL_CATALOG in Admin > "
"Providers > Models) was not registered: …`）。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:434
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A route whose `${VAR}` key or `base_url` is unset drops its model, and "
"the log names the model and the variable. Mark the route `optional: true`"
" to drop only that route."
msgstr ""
"如果路由中 `${VAR}` 形式的 key 或 `base_url` 未设置，整个模型都会被丢弃，日志会写明模型和变量。把路由标记为 "
"`optional: true`，则只丢弃这条路由。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:437
msgid ""
"Check the model's required role, and for an Admin Routing model, whether "
"its route is verified and applied."
msgstr "检查模型所需的角色；对于在 Admin Routing 中创建的模型，还要检查它的路由是否已验证并生效。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:439
msgid ""
"An alias claimed by two models resolves to the one loaded last, with a "
"warning in the log."
msgstr "被两个模型同时声明的别名会解析到最后加载的那个模型，日志中会有警告。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:442
msgid "Authentication failures"
msgstr "鉴权失败"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:444
msgid "A `401` from the gateway means your gateway API key is missing or invalid."
msgstr "网关返回的 `401` 表示你的网关 API key 缺失或无效。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:445
msgid ""
"A `401` from the upstream usually means a wrong upstream key. Chat logs "
"it as `upstream_auth_misconfig`; embeddings log `Embedding request failed"
" for model=...`. Some gateways also answer 401 for an unknown path, so "
"check the URL and `embeddings_path` first."
msgstr ""
"上游返回的 `401` 通常表示上游 key 有误。chat 请求会记录为 "
"`upstream_auth_misconfig`；embeddings 请求记录为 `Embedding request failed for "
"model=...`。有些网关对未知路径也返回 401，所以先检查 URL 和 `embeddings_path`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:449
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Only a whole value of the form `${NAME}` is expanded, and only in "
"`base_url`, `api_key`, `api_keys`, `provider_model_id` and a route's "
"`embeddings_path`."
msgstr ""
"只有整个值为 `${NAME}` 形式时才会展开，而且只在 "
"`base_url`、`api_key`、`api_keys`、`provider_model_id` 和路由的 "
"`embeddings_path` 中展开。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:452
msgid ""
"For a runnable gateway from first request to local server, see the "
"[Quickstart](router-tutorial.md)."
msgstr "想从第一个请求一直跑到接入本地服务器，见[快速开始](router-tutorial.md)。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:417
msgid ""
"Errors follow the normal fallback and [circuit breaker](routing.md"
"#endpoint-health-and-circuit-breaking) rules. 401 (a rejected OpenRouter "
"key) and 407 (an egress proxy) count against the circuit and page. 402 "
"and 403 do not count by themselves, but on an `api_keys:` pool they "
"rotate and then mute the key, so an account out of credit soon has no "
"usable key and the circuit opens. 403 does not page, because providers "
"also use it to refuse single requests. If every OpenRouter request "
"returns 401, the gateway's key is wrong: check it in **Admin → "
"Providers**."
msgstr ""
"错误遵循常规的回退和[熔断](routing.md#endpoint-health-and-circuit-"
"breaking)规则。401（OpenRouter key 被拒）和 407（出口代理要求认证）会计入熔断并发出告警。402 和 403 "
"本身不计入，但在 `api_keys:` 池中会触发 key 轮换，随后静默该 key，所以余额耗尽的账户很快就没有可用的 "
"key，熔断器随之打开。403 不发告警，因为 provider 也会用它拒绝单个请求。如果所有 OpenRouter 请求都返回 "
"401，说明网关的 key 有误：请在 **Admin → Providers** 中检查。"

